EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I got a job for ya!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Will you bury a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}time capsule {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}for me?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}See{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I heard it's good luck to get
