actually pretty superstitious.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}But you'll do it for me, won't ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Bury it?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
