Can't right now.

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
I got something for you to do!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}So{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}will you bury this {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}time capsule{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
for me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} I've written down my life's
goals in a letter to my future self.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}But if I keep it around, I'm gonna be
tempted to rewrite it{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}so I'm gonna
have it buried in the ground!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}And I want you to do the honors!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}How 'bout it?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Will ya help me out?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Sounds great!
Sounds silly.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ehi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ho qualcosa da farti fare!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Dovresti sotterrare questa {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}capsula
del tempo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} per me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} Dentro ci sono
anche i miei propositi per il futuro!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ma se non la sotterro in fretta, mi
verrà la tentazione di cambiarli{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
quindi mi devo spicciare!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}E vorrei che ci pensassi tu.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Che ne dici?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti va di sotterrarla?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
